00:48:03,433 --> 00:48:05,467
詹姆斯还紧紧跟在他后面，
James was still on his tail,

828
00:48:05,500 --> 00:48:07,733
斯提格仍在隧道里，
The Stig was still
in a tunnel,

829
00:48:07,767 --> 00:48:12,467
